Network 20 (cooling/sgchem/cxx/chem_cool_net20.cc and related files)
  Thermochemistry of TIGRESS-NCR, Kim et al. 2023, ApJS 264, 10 (arXiv:2210.08024), implemented from the paper.
  Coefficients the paper only cites were taken from the authors' public implementation (pyathena, microphysics/cool.py,
  commit f188a84; Athena++ shielding.cpp). Terms of that code: to be confirmed.

Used as installed libraries (not included): SUNDIALS/CVODE (BSD-3), Kokkos.
